Source terminal keyboard controls
----------------------------------
The optional terminal key toolbar adapts HAPI 0f8ef697's browser keyboard
controls, Haven layout and customization semantics (AGPL-3.0-only), and
TermBeam's key-combination encoder and pointer-repeat behavior (MIT).
It composes with the unchanged official DSH terminal view and writes through
that view's public input owner; it does not include a different terminal server.

