Speech and voice adapters
-------------------------
The original HAPI voice protocol, personality, prompt/context formatting,
browser-local eligibility, audio conversion and provider lifecycle modules are
adapted under AGPL-3.0-only. Per-file original source paths are preserved;
the pinned revision and integration changes are recorded in src/voice/UPSTREAM.md.

