Conversation image export
-------------------------
The browser artifact bundles unmodified html2canvas-pro 2.2.4, the version
pinned by the original HAPI baseline, to rasterize a reviewed, read-only copy
of the official DSH Conversation DOM. It does not replace a chat renderer.
